Graham categorized investors into two types:
Defensive Investors: Prioritize capital preservation via low-cost index funds or a diversified
portfolio of large-cap stocks.
Enterprising Investors: Actively seek undervalued stocks using Grahamʼs quantitative
screens (e.g., net-net stocks, P/E  15x) .
