Grahamʼs The Intelligent Investor remains the cornerstone of value investing, offering timeless
principles for navigating market cycles. Key takeaways include:
Margin of Safety: Never overpay, regardless of market sentiment.
Emotional Discipline: Treat volatility as an opportunity, not a threat.
Adaptation: Combine Grahamʼs qualitative insights with quantitative tools (e.g., factor
models).
