Conclusion and Recommendations

Future Research: Explore machine learning applications to automate Grahamʼs stock screens or
assess ESG factors within his framework. For now, investors adhering to Grahamʼs philosophy are
poised to achieve what he termed "satisfactory results"—steady compounding shielded from
Wall Streetʼs excesses.
“The intelligent investor is a realist who sells to optimists and buys from pessimists.” Benjamin
Graham .
